570
00:21:13,648 --> 00:21:15,358
He was--

571
00:21:15,483 --> 00:21:18,027
He was with me the whole time.

572
00:21:18,152 --> 00:21:20,363
Oh.
Well, Stan, we're, uh--

573
00:21:20,488 --> 00:21:22,615
